  "body": "Perfectly positioned in the heart of sought-after Long Bay, this beautifully designed standalone home offers the ideal balance of relaxed coastal living and modern everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Long Bay Beach, scenic coastal walkways, local cafés, parks, and the vibrant village centre, this home offers the best of beach living while delivering the comfort and practicality families want.\r\n\r\nDesigned with effortless living in mind, the home features light-filled open-plan living and dining, complemented by a stylish contemporary kitchen with quality appliances and generous storage. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow creates the perfect setting for entertaining, summer gatherings, or simply unwinding after a day at the beach.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, spacious bedrooms provide peaceful retreats for the whole family, including a well-appointed master suite complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first step into Long Bay, a stylish family home, or an easy-care coastal retreat, this is an opportunity that perfectly captures the modern Long Bay lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n• Freehold standalone home\r\n• Approx. 150m² floor area\r\n• 3 spacious bedrooms & 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• Master suite with walk-in wardrobe & ensuite\r\n• Designer kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Ducted heating & modern comforts\r\n• Internal access garage plus additional parking\r\n• Low-maintenance, easy-care section\r\n• Close to Long Bay Beach, village, cafés & reserves\r\n• Zoned for excellent local schools\r\n\r\nLive moments from the beach and enjoy the lifestyle Long Bay is famous for. Your coastal dream starts here!\r\nContact us for more information.",
